	"data": "Concept: Solid Pod Sovereignty\n\nWhat It Is\n\nThe Solid Protocol (Tim Berners-Lee, MIT) is the decentralized data layer for the Cybernautics ecosystem. A Solid Pod is a personal data store you fully control — apps request access to your data rather than owning it. You grant, revoke, and scope permissions per resource.\n\n\"My Solid pod is my Cybership.\"\n\nThis is not a speculative alignment. The Solid Protocol implements exactly the data sovereignty principles cithoreal articulated independently in…",
